ting tumor cells, disease progression, and survival in metastatic breast cancer</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>2004</year><volume>351</volume><fpage>781</fpage><lpage>791</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15317891</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1056/NEJMoa040766</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Marshall</surname><given-names>RLCJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Friedman</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Hayden</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hodges</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Holas</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Jennings</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Jou</surname><given-names>CK</given-names></name><name><surname>Kratochvil</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Laffler</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Lewis</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Scheffel</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Traylor</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Solomon</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Detection of gb virus c by the rt-pcr lcx system</article-title><source>J Virol Methods</source><year>1998</year><volume>73</volume><fpage>99</fpage><lpage>107</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9705181</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0166-0934(98)00050-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jarvinen</surname><given-names>TA</given-names></name><name><surname>Tanner</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Rantanen</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Barlund</surname><given-names>M</giv